"excerpt":"满池荷叶动秋风。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1620","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"落花凝恨夕阳中。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1621","title":"鹧鸪天 生日自寿赋谢人庆寿","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"生羡鸡冠与凤仙。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1622","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"虎掌葵花一锭银。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1623","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"巧匠园缝异样花。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1624","title":"鹧鸪天 寿妇人","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"织女初秋渡鹊河。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1625","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"题得相思字数行。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1626","title":"鹧鸪天 其一 车中","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"紫陌朱轮去似流。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1627","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","excerpt":"轩辕起置号齐云。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1628","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"冷落人间昼掩门。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1629","title":"鹧鸪天 其六 上元词","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"宝炬金莲一万条。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1630","title":"鹧鸪天 集曲名","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"烛影摇红玉漏迟。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1631","title":"鹧鸪天 秋榜将开得子","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"菊釂萸残玉未颓。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1632","title":"鹧鸪天 寿赵簿","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"当日名驹产渥洼。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1633","title":"鹧鸪天 七月廿七","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"秋至人间灏气清。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1634","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"小小池亭自有凉。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1635","title":"鹧鸪天 三月初二","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"罗袜凌波洛浦仙。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1636","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"往事旧游浑似梦。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1637","title":"鹧鸪天","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"山色晴岚景物佳。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1638","title":"鹧鸪天 佳人","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"全似丹青揾染成。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1639","title":"檐前铁","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"悄无人，宿雨厌厌，空庭乍歇。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1640","title":"霜天晓角","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"一声阿鹊。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1641","title":"霜叶飞","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"故宫秋晚馀芳尽，轻阴闲淡池阁。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1642","title":"鬓边华","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"小梅香细艳浅。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1643","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"众鸟不喜亦不悲，又复别寻高树枝。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1644","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"祖来产业分兄弟，身后诗书遗子孙。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1645","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"三春花发惟樗树，二月莺啼是老鸦。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1646","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"赢得儿童叫夫子，可怜名位只都官。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1647","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"城边一水抱城流，城外群山拥郡楼。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1648","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"但看建德安民榜，即是虚翁德政碑。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1649","title":"句 其二","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"地下若逢秦相国，也应不说到沅湘。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1650","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"不到施黔不见山。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1651","title":"句","author":"无名妇人","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"蚌胎光透壳，犀角晕盈尖。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1652","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"楚国封疆六千里，荆门岩峦十二碚。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1653","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"天涯亭下有龙窟，林冶山头出碎金。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1654","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"啼月杜鹃喉舌冷，宿花蝴蝶梦魂香。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1655","title":"句 其一","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"一色楼台三十里，不知何处觅孤山。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1656","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"文章却似呼延赞，风貌全同富相公。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1657","title":"句","author":"李廷彦","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"舍弟江南没，家兄塞北亡。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1658","title":"句","author":"无名氏","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"鸟鸣深夜岂知形，彻晓音喧响更清。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1659","title":"郊寺","author":"木待问","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"红委墙阴花寂寂，翠滋亭角草纤纤。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1660","title":"千里思","author":"木待问","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"君行千里轻所历，妾驰千里心匪石。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1661","title":"火后寄诠老","author":"木待问","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"搀枪堕九霄，列缺乱阡陌。","body":56},{"id":"song-era:1662","title":"句 其一","author":"周虎臣","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"綵旆西来横铁瓮，大江东转涌金山。","body":{"start":1662,"hash":"bc111663fa414f9deca3f8a29ccb60466fc99269498384ee2909309293cc9c8a"}},{"id":"song-era:1663","title":"满庭芳","author":"去非","collection":"宋","notice":"","excerpt":"龙角辉春，蛾春惊晓，梦阑金翠屏开。","body":126}]